    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__Subscription__c records with null SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c.
Why it matters: Mid-term subscriptions can&apos;t proration-bill correctly — customers either get over-billed (and dispute) or under-billed (revenue leak). Common on subs created outside the standard CPQ flow.
Suppress a finding: when subs were intentionally created without proration (annual flat billing).
Disable the detector: only when proration is never used. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
